/* ---------- planetary battlefield catalogue ---------------------------------
   A site is a map, not a skin placed over a generic size toggle. Every one of
   the sixteen regions owns an authored Small, Medium and Large battlefield.
   The fixed 3.2 km terrain allocation is retained for mobile memory stability;
   `size` selects the playable theatre within it (see BATTLEFIELD_PRESETS).

   The eight legacy definitions remain addressable for campaign/save
   compatibility, but no War Room region advertises them. */
